WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:14.095
<v Hazel>Hazel: Do you hear that?</v>

2
00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:15.375
<v Ember>Ember: They're singing!</v>

3
00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:21.045
<v Clover>Clover: We did it. We really did it.</v>

4
00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:25.333
<v Rotcrown>Rotcrown: Endings are how new things
begin. I had forgotten.</v>

5
00:00:32.092 --> 00:00:33.962
<v Hazel>Hazel: Okay. I could get used to this.</v>

6
00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.880
<v Rowan>Rowan: Huh. My helmet fits now.</v>

7
00:00:39.008 --> 00:00:43.458
<v Ember>Ember: Mossback's book stops here. 'And so
the Accord was kept.'</v>

8
00:00:43.967 --> 00:00:45.977
<v Ember>Ember: So... what happens in the next
verse?</v>

9
00:00:46.925 --> 00:00:48.125
<v Hazel>Hazel: Guess we write it.</v>

